---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Loop from '../components/Loop.astro';
import Window from '../components/Window.astro';
import Copy from '../components/Copy.astro';
import { latestRelease } from '../lib/release';
import capture from '../../../docs/media/capture-light.png';
import editor from '../../../docs/media/editor.png';
import videoEditor from '../../../docs/media/video-editor.png';
import openAnyway from '../../../docs/media/open-anyway.png';

const release = await latestRelease();
const full = '(min-width: 1120px) 1088px, 100vw';
const half = '(min-width: 900px) 540px, 100vw';
---

<Base>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>A better <kbd class="key">⌘</kbd><kbd class="key">⇧</kbd><kbd class="key">4</kbd></h1>
      <p class="lede">Shot is a screenshot app that sits in your menu bar. It uses the keys you already know.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="button big" href="/download">Download Shot</a>
        <Copy command="brew install lorcanchinnock/tap/shot" />
      </div>
      <p class="meta">Free and open source. Version {release.version}, for macOS 15 on Apple Silicon.</p>
      <Window>
        <Loop name="hero" label="Pressing ⌘⇧4, drawing an arrow and a note on the screenshot, then pasting it into another app" eager />
      </Window>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="say">Let go of the mouse and the screenshot is already copied and saved. A little card shows up in the corner, and you can drag it straight into a message.</p>
      <Window><Image src={capture} alt="Selecting an area with the magnifier, then the Quick Access card in the corner of the screen" widths={[640, 1088, 1600]} sizes={full} /></Window>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap pair">
      <div>
        <p class="say">Press A for an arrow, or B to blur a phone number.</p>
        <Window><Image src={editor} alt="The annotation editor with arrows, a sticky note, a blurred email address, and notes beside the screenshot" widths={[540, 1080]} sizes={half} /></Window>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="say"><kbd class="key">⌘</kbd><kbd class="key">⇧</kbd><kbd class="key">5</kbd> records instead. Your face can come too.</p>
        <Window><Loop name="recording" label="Recording an area of the screen with the round camera bubble in the corner" /></Window>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="say">Then cut the part where you went looking for the right tab, and save it as a GIF.</p>
      <Window><Image src={videoEditor} alt="The video editor with trim handles, a cut, and the GIF export options" widths={[640, 1088, 1600]} sizes={full} /></Window>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="small">
    <div class="wrap narrow-text">
      <p>There's no account to make. Shot only goes online to check for updates, and it asks you first. The <a href="https://github.com/LorcanChinnock/shot">code is on GitHub</a> if you want to look.</p>
      <p>Everything else is in the <a href="/docs/">guide</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="install" id="install">
    <div class="wrap pair">
      <div>
        <h2>Install</h2>
        <Copy command="brew install lorcanchinnock/tap/shot" />
        <p>Or <a href="/download">download the zip</a> and drag Shot into Applications.</p>
        <p>Shot isn't notarized by Apple yet, so macOS blocks it the first time. Open System Settings, go to Privacy &amp; Security, and click Open Anyway.</p>
      </div>
      <Image src={openAnyway} alt="Privacy & Security in System Settings, with the Open Anyway button next to the message that Shot was blocked" widths={[480, 723]} sizes={half} class="shot" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); }
  .hero .wrap { justify-items: start; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 80px); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.18em; }
  .hero h1 .key { font-size: 0.62em; padding: 0.05em 0.3em; border-width: 3px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 22px); margin: 0; max-width: 30em; }
  .cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: center; width: 100%; }
  .cta :global(.copy) { flex: 0 1 460px; min-width: 0; }
  .button.big { min-height: 52px; padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 18px; }
  .meta { margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); }
  .hero :global(.window) { width: 100%; }

  section { padding-block: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); }
  .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .say { font: 800 clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px)/1.3 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0; max-width: 30em; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .say .key { font-size: 0.75em; }

  .pair { display: grid; gap: 40px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .pair { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; } }
  .pair > * { min-width: 0; display: grid; gap: 20px; align-content: start; }

  .narrow-text p { max-width: 36em; }
  .small p { font-size: 19px; margin: 0; }
  .small a, .install a { font-weight: 700; }

  .install h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 38px); }
  .install p { margin: 0; }
  .install :global(.shot) { border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 10px; }
</style>
